            <div xml:id="m-d10dc5e1-0a02-4694-b3db-8048a68b3111">
              <lg xml:id="m-8fbe0748-a078-4b50-8a99-bb1680e48ced">
                <l xml:id="m-8cfcc619-42c1-4a6f-8545-6567d8b11b7f" facs="#m-91dfd008-6646-4ab8-a9b2-583330089537" label="ambiguous">Wednesday in Holy Week</l><l xml:id="m-9af18f04-f261-405a-b273-4440a432b3a3" facs="#m-65178fbe-07ee-4cf5-96d1-65863ded1086" label="ambiguous">617</l><l xml:id="m-0bd4b2f0-9ae4-4af4-af63-334a5e3c0e44" facs="#m-c61453bd-afdb-4af1-89ec-83e9899b40c0" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-f9c68e2f-f18b-4781-a15f-f9b53affe38c" facs="#m-3b7f0788-c8df-40a8-9dbc-b685d455185a" label="text-like">Prayer</l><l xml:id="m-cb8cf0ed-1259-465e-9241-a718cbfd01ce" facs="#m-334aa1c4-0fda-4564-bec2-7f0865ca5cb6" label="lyrics-like">ORaesta, quaésumus, omnípo¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb6f4087-e80a-4e88-9cb6-fa6139660a63" facs="#m-3456ee90-8a3f-4b97-a8b2-ce12233e8803" label="lyrics-like">mur, per unigéniti Fslii tui pas¬</l><l xml:id="m-cf48b524-1480-419b-8446-5a63d108dae2" facs="#m-b77ceda6-448d-400d-b28e-fe01b67a162c" label="ambiguous">Ltens Deus; ut, qui nostris</l><l xml:id="m-7c4bc465-3ac1-4c13-a602-94c8b0435407" facs="#m-8eb38e0d-e7f3-4ca5-9b56-abe17221651b" label="lyrics-like">siónem liberémur: Qui tecum</l><l xml:id="m-7c02f277-fc85-4aeb-b737-43307b414f16" facs="#m-4b8aac5a-153c-4a8b-8e15-a2f859ba0215" label="lyrics-like">excéssibus incessánter affligi-] vivit.</l><l xml:id="m-257c1634-d01e-4585-8578-74abbd2f82d7" facs="#m-f849cae3-c364-4d1a-83fb-5650e2be734d" label="ambiguous">Lectio Isaiae Prophetae. 62, 11;63, 1-7</l><l xml:id="m-6c26cd6e-599d-498e-9d84-74f0e46775d7" facs="#m-739b1b08-0292-41ca-adab-4c39f265fcf5" label="lyrics-like">KÆC dicit Dóminus Deus: eórum super vestiménta mea,</l><l xml:id="m-74743d6f-3cd4-4627-bc4a-b8bc8ea918eb" facs="#m-c8ced413-530b-42fb-b9b0-308617e18bc2" label="text-like">At Dicite flliae Sion: Ecce Sal¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff1c0dac-52b5-48c9-8fca-69bd3be1a194" facs="#m-adfd3458-17d8-4683-9cfb-75d2e433f84a" label="lyrics-like">et ómnia induménta mea inqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-93992244-3c43-49d9-91d3-5ffab6361d2a" facs="#m-225749e8-4397-4a31-a39c-65936cea3783" label="lyrics-like">návi. Dies enim ultiónis in corde</l><l xml:id="m-bf59ec6b-e246-44eb-8da7-715816aea825" facs="#m-b1415794-138a-4408-afd6-e16a2fe6bd27" label="lyrics-like">vátor tuus venit: ecce merces</l><l xml:id="m-6607423d-13e1-4c2b-8989-3cc269c47fb5" facs="#m-6d331427-3107-45de-9005-df151713c5c5" label="ambiguous">ejus cum co. Quis est iste, qui</l><l xml:id="m-52c740d7-7bf0-4e1e-bdd8-e70ce982ac3c" facs="#m-c1668800-e549-408d-82db-97cc78d6332e" label="lyrics-like">meo, annus redemptiónis meae</l><l xml:id="m-c2fa0d8e-c9af-4ed8-b2ff-8ed7b07f033c" facs="#m-8d4207b6-771f-4620-9feb-b77cb0672983" label="lyrics-like">venit de Edom, tinctis véstibus</l><l xml:id="m-6b9f3a42-6efc-4217-811b-a6d96814c9e1" facs="#m-916a21b6-ad02-4f43-bfeb-cd4743e61d2d" label="lyrics-like">venit. Circumspéxi, et non erat</l><l xml:id="m-ac11b6eb-65b0-4dba-828f-288c432f028d" facs="#m-d7e31cf5-a24a-4bc7-8044-160a05151c4d" label="lyrics-like">de Bosra? Iste formósus in stola</l><l xml:id="m-2fc453c7-faf0-4138-92da-6752057301ae" facs="#m-ff2ba312-6290-41bc-9801-b62b21a6441c" label="lyrics-like">auxiliátor: quaesivi, et non</l><l xml:id="m-c2d35593-6c51-4696-83c8-1fda9e1cd137" facs="#m-63aaa2c7-bde3-4288-bb0a-e33780a62add" label="lyrics-like">sua, grádiens in multitúdine</l><l xml:id="m-2312bd06-f344-4de1-9d8f-4e97d821afac" facs="#m-6d810d1a-5952-42c8-bd68-cc821d9da19f" label="lyrics-like">fuit qui adjuváret: et salvávit</l><l xml:id="m-a3429857-6d0b-40b8-b530-e4c0267821e3" facs="#m-b13cfc74-1d20-490d-86bb-cb6e30a53c8f" label="lyrics-like">fortitúdinis suae. Ego, qui loquor</l><l xml:id="m-ea6b9ae7-cd58-48db-83be-dfa03fd64a1a" facs="#m-d2cdc1c5-ec39-413f-87ff-088e42bab76a" label="lyrics-like">mihi bráchium meum, et indi¬</l><l xml:id="m-45e927ab-bf21-4e63-9a4c-c8653e6afe0f" facs="#m-dc3dd461-8624-4b61-96eb-e94707f7c271" label="lyrics-like">justitiam, et propugnátor sum</l><l xml:id="m-69d79542-d78f-4473-89d4-f1a3d00176b5" facs="#m-30bdecf8-9bb9-4c12-a35b-1d6e6151ad20" label="lyrics-like">gnátio mea ipsa auxiliáta est</l><l xml:id="m-d3d202cf-b9d3-4737-a93e-1d3abc52bee5" facs="#m-f37a69a9-749a-4a9a-b582-dd03413db63f" label="lyrics-like">ad salvándum. Quare ergo ru¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5b44b4d-8670-4cce-99ea-a35307d44c33" facs="#m-3807bcd3-f7ab-4083-8b67-ceaec8bf4ef2" label="lyrics-like">mihi. Et conculcávi pópulos in</l><l xml:id="m-5f1479f2-d1cb-4c8f-8df1-aac6553d3f27" facs="#m-30f5243b-e354-44dc-9360-bf28153ad7f4" label="lyrics-like">brum est induméntum tuum, et</l><l xml:id="m-424eb679-8aca-4db8-b211-8c52bf80b75e" facs="#m-104fdc4a-ebf2-4bdb-9857-da9c9a76bf7b" label="lyrics-like">furóre meo, et inebriávi eos in</l><l xml:id="m-796d4293-ab11-4001-bdb3-935f237e1bfa" facs="#m-006eba65-5d0b-474f-bd9b-72a12c60f9f9" label="lyrics-like">indignatióne mea, et detráxi in</l><l xml:id="m-6a2b75e8-f36d-4955-9e74-68a73f102374" facs="#m-b022884c-51ff-44ff-838c-e28338b04efc" label="lyrics-like">vestiménta tua, sicut calcántium</l><l xml:id="m-aaee5fe2-72b9-4ee8-b500-aedde9370e1f" facs="#m-4654501f-5cda-4bdb-83cb-87e055b05ac9" label="lyrics-like">in torculári? Tórcular calcávi</l><l xml:id="m-d3846113-8046-40ea-af86-6b3eef58752c" facs="#m-39c398df-679d-41a0-a826-9f39d21ea28e" label="lyrics-like">terram virtútem córum. Misera¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf4be8f3-8554-4bce-b881-238992b7d781" facs="#m-a0813a6f-938a-408d-9a9c-786d3caa08cf" label="lyrics-like">solus, et de géntibus non est</l><l xml:id="m-e0c7e2b0-9c85-4d6c-b8f6-21e6684a30e9" facs="#m-17496e27-784f-436e-aa14-7fb761ef726f" label="lyrics-like">tiónum Dómini recordábor, lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d9fbfe5-476f-4587-8adc-ae3e13367cfb" facs="#m-6e8694af-4019-4605-8e0c-26dd09fda7d0" label="lyrics-like">dem Dómini super ómnibus,</l><l xml:id="m-eb8c3e06-202d-4e90-a7c0-e75227b1ec57" facs="#m-e5b49b7e-0bb5-41c4-a01f-d78b49a6790b" label="lyrics-like">vir mecum: calcávi eos in furóre</l><l xml:id="m-e21c8d77-94f6-4171-af74-45da075c67de" facs="#m-1f11ba77-2980-40f8-be3c-43c0452c2ddf" label="lyrics-like">quae réddidit nobis Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-74475800-f523-41f6-9bb3-2c23cf3f6fbb" facs="#m-195e3b1b-bb97-4381-b72b-88760c19df13" label="lyrics-like">meo, et conculcávi eos in ira</l><l xml:id="m-7c184a8d-2b8c-4ad8-8af8-b0cf69eabde0" facs="#m-70f820a3-d71c-445f-8803-0bffc6c3df4f" label="lyrics-like">mea: et aspérsus est sanguis Deus noster.</l><l xml:id="m-7db22442-eacf-499f-8c58-baa18ef4da77" facs="#m-52373922-6714-402c-86fa-c364efa0b837" label="ambiguous">drad.</l><l xml:id="m-ef67479f-c08c-46e5-b8b1-a0eb23e7838b" facs="#m-c6b89689-941a-4b46-8e22-326b07c3b2b9" label="lyrics-like">E avér-tas“fáci¬em</l><l xml:id="m-617fa16f-c6af-443b-b2ca-6242fb34abff" facs="#m-c515b08b-3b59-41eb-9816-4aded22235a5" label="lyrics-like">tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-00d758fd-15b6-4464-8c96-86eac30a901e" facs="#m-43896890-1d6b-4b25-8e34-9e4fc44fe64f" label="lyrics-like">am a pú¬</l><l xml:id="m-9a3f0006-5bb9-4746-b4d7-e9a776b2f547" facs="#m-29a2b603-3b06-4225-9ea0-67185b1bb93f" label="lyrics-like">quó-ni-am trí¬</l><l xml:id="m-c3b82153-3680-4cf1-9fb0-23b9a0d83609" facs="#m-119a9464-dfc7-4873-8604-085f03e7bf40" label="lyrics-like">tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-93c6fa4f-f6e5-4897-8c5f-55d21978a2fb" facs="#m-a67b42c8-2ef6-4b63-a7de-8e3ac0324a92" label="ambiguous">o,</l><l xml:id="m-389e77f0-1281-483f-aa4f-2f1bfb064ffa" facs="#m-d9046e72-b62c-43cd-bf5b-39d709490e57" label="ambiguous">e-ro</l><l xml:id="m-2f60c3a8-3836-4940-8f69-2b4f3e81f1f0" facs="#m-357f9aa4-8ea5-4d0b-8dfe-5dede0a54304" label="lyrics-like">exáudi me.</l><l xml:id="m-83b77171-d321-4a04-9b5c-7b7d991a3b36" facs="#m-b9868bb3-81f7-402d-8d56-74a44d15d7b0" label="ambiguous">bu-lor:</l><l xml:id="m-9a2386d4-6f26-4cfd-a6f3-9f9af77817a1" facs="#m-e9a7a1d8-d484-469d-952b-dde031589296" label="lyrics-like">ve-ló-ci-ter</l><l xml:id="m-c0e83817-5411-42d9-b8a1-d91cdb080fcf" facs="#m-84c185c8-04df-42af-82e6-90be4e6e0300" label="lyrics-like">V. Sálvum me fac, Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-7bb66956-4dd9-4499-9886-0d61f807aacb" facs="#m-1c8254a8-1283-46d9-a3c9-88ce6fd8ea82" label="lyrics-like">us, quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-3601ea73-7516-4ad6-8171-a0a6e28197cc" facs="#m-12c92355-eb1f-4a19-a93c-646d06b46014" label="ambiguous">ni-am</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
